WEBVTT

00:00:12.664 --> 00:00:14.024
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> What’s in your bag?

00:00:14.761 --> 00:00:19.309
<v><b>Richard:</b></v> Er, my coat, and water, and wallet.

00:00:27.482 --> 00:00:28.928
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> What’s in your bag?

00:00:30.195 --> 00:00:34.789
<v><b>Rachel:</b></v> In my bag I keep my purse, my phone, and an umbrella.

00:00:44.001 --> 00:00:46.919
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Are you from a big or small family?

00:00:47.638 --> 00:00:49.178
<v><b>Kieran:</b></v> I’m from a small family.

00:00:49.179 --> 00:00:52.999
I have my mum, my dad, and one little sister.

00:01:01.787 --> 00:01:05.840
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> How much is a cup of coffee in your local coffee shop?

00:01:05.939 --> 00:01:07.640
<v><b>Debra:</b></v> It’s four dollars.

00:01:07.699 --> 00:01:10.909
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Do you think it’s cheap or expensive?

00:01:10.969 --> 00:01:12.789
<v><b>Debra:</b></v> I think it’s expensive.

00:01:21.053 --> 00:01:23.397
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Can you describe your car?

00:01:24.276 --> 00:01:29.124
<v><b>Susan:</b></v> I have a Fiat five hundred automatic, so a small car.